<Base title="Privacy policy" description="What personal information Ivan’s Prod collects, and what it doesn’t.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="note">Last updated: November 26, 2026</p>
  <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
  <p>Ivan’s Prod (ivansprod.com) is run by Ivan. For any question about your personal information, write to <a href="mailto:ivan@ivansprod.com">ivan@ivansprod.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>What I collect today</h2>
  <p>This site has no forms, accounts or comments, and I don’t use analytics or advertising cookies. Joining my email list happens outside this site, through GetResponse. If you email me, I receive your email address and your message. I use them only to reply to you.</p>
  <h2>My email list</h2>
  <p>I send emails about AI tools I have tested: what worked, what didn’t, and whether the tool is for you. I collect your email address, and your first name if you give it. I use them only to send you these emails. Some emails contain affiliate links, and I say so when they do.</p>
  <p>I send these emails with GetResponse, which stores your address on my behalf. I never sell or rent your address. Every email includes an unsubscribe link, and you can also write to <a href="mailto:ivan@ivansprod.com">ivan@ivansprod.com</a> to be removed. I will act on your request promptly.</p>
  <p>I only email people who have agreed to receive my messages. If you believe you are on my list by mistake, tell me and I will remove you right away.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted by Cloudflare. To deliver and protect the pages, Cloudflare may process technical data such as your IP address and browser type.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you click an affiliate link, you leave this site. The company you land on may use cookies to track that I referred you, and its own privacy policy applies there.</p>
  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If I change how I collect or use personal information, I will update this page first and show the date above.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask me what personal information I hold about you, and ask me to correct or delete it, by writing to the address above.</p>
</Base>
